# Seed .gitignore — keeps local-only files out before Phase 0 lands the full .NET ruleset.
# Phase 0 of Sprint 1 (Dash) EXTENDS this file with the standard .NET entries
# (bin/, obj/, .vs/, *.user, TestResults/, *.partial, etc.) — it does NOT replace it.

# Local AI agent definitions (per-developer copies, never committed).
# Files matching this pattern live in each developer's working tree but are
# personal to that developer's setup. Shared/team agents (no -local suffix)
# may live alongside and ARE tracked.
.github/agents/*-local.agent.md

# In-progress file copies from the get-and-see tool itself, if anyone ever
# runs the tool with the repo as destination by accident.
*.partial
